  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 1236291,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 09 Chairs: A Dreamcast Puzzle Adventure\n\nStep into the bizarre and unsettling world of *09 Chairs*, a unique puzzle adventure game for the Sega Dreamcast. You awaken in a surreal, minimalist hotel lobby, inexplicably stripped of your memory and surrounded by nine identical chairs.  A disembodied voice guides you, tasking you with rearranging these chairs to unlock the secrets of your past and escape the unsettling environment.\n\nGameplay revolves around manipulating the chairs, rotating and shifting them to create specific patterns and trigger events. Each successful arrangement reveals fragmented memories and clues, slowly piecing together the narrative. The game’s atmosphere is thick with psychological tension, utilizing a haunting soundtrack and unsettling visuals to create a truly memorable experience. \n\n*09 Chairs* isn’t about action; it’s about observation, deduction, and confronting the unsettling nature of memory and identity.  Prepare to be challenged and disturbed as you unravel the mystery of the nine chairs and your own forgotten story.  A truly original and thought-provoking title for the Dreamcast."
    },
